        "Cars and machines never serviced. A car mechanic told the Shaykh: “The biggest waste now is in machines. People know how to drive, but not how to look after them. Oil is not changed on time, and in the end they lose out.” || Hech qaralmaydigan mashina va asbob-uskunalar. Bir avtoulov ustasi Shayxga: “Hozir eng katta isrof texnikada. Odamlar haydashni bilishadi, lekin avaylashni emas. Moy vaqtida almashtirilmaydi, oqibatda o‘zlari zarar ko‘rishadi”, degan.",
        "Today we can add phones and gadgets replaced every year while the old ones still work. || Bugun bunga eskisi ishlab turgan bo‘lsa ham har yili almashtiriladigan telefon va qurilmalarni ham qo‘shish mumkin.",
      ]),
      L("Winding back the meter is theft || Hisoblagichni orqaga aylantirish — o‘g‘rilik", [
        "Making electricity, gas or water meters show less than was used is spreading, and many do not think of it as a sin. || Elektr, gaz yoki suv hisoblagichlarini kamroq ko‘rsatadigan qilish keng tarqalmoqda, ko‘pchilik buni gunoh deb ham bilmaydi.",
        "In truth it is theft, and not from one person but from the whole public. || Aslida bu o‘g‘rilik, bir shaxsdan emas, butun jamiyatdan.",
        "Those payments help fund care for orphans, pensioners and families in need. Cheating them is a heavy wrong. || Bu to‘lovlar yetim-yesirlar, nafaqaxo‘rlar va kam ta’minlanganlar ehtiyojiga ham sarflanadi. Ularni aldash og‘ir zulm.",
        "“Do not consume one another’s wealth unjustly” (4:29). || “Mollaringizni o‘rtangizda botil yo‘l bilan yemang” (4:29).",
      ]),
      { type: "compare", title: "A thrifty home checklist || Tejamkor uy ro‘yxati", left: "Waste || Isrof", right: "Thrift || Tejamkorlik", rows: [
        ["Lights on in empty rooms || Bo‘sh xonada yoniq chiroq", "Last one out turns it off || Oxirgi chiqqan o‘chiradi"],
        ["Charger left plugged in all day || Kun bo‘yi rozetkada qolgan zaryadlovchi", "Unplug when done || Ish bitgach, ajrating"],
        ["Car run until it breaks || Buzilguncha haydalgan mashina", "Serviced on time || Vaqtida xizmat ko‘rsatiladi"],
        ["Meter wound back || Orqaga aylantirilgan hisoblagich", "Honest bills, paid in full || Halol, to‘liq to‘langan hisob"],
      ] },
      L("What the book asks of us || Kitob bizdan nimani so‘raydi", [
        "Isrof harms individuals, families and societies, and its harm reaches into the Hereafter. || Isrof yakka shaxslarga ham, oilalarga ham, jamiyatlarga ham zarar, uning zarari oxiratga ham o‘tadi.",
        "So we must fight it together: each person, each family and the whole community. || Shuning uchun unga birgalikda qarshi turishimiz kerak: har bir kishi, har bir oila va butun jamiyat.",
        "Knowledge comes first. Imams, schools, media and families should all teach about it, through lessons, poems, stories and every means. || Avvalo ilm. Imomlar, maktablar, matbuot va oilalar dars, she’r, hikoya va barcha vositalar orqali o‘rgatishi kerak.",
        "Then the thrift becomes a good deed: it benefits ourselves, our family economy, our society and our whole country, and it earns reward. || Shunda tejamkorlik solih amalga aylanadi: o‘zimizga, oilaviy iqtisodimizga, jamiyatimizga va butun yurtimizga foyda beradi va savob keltiradi.",
      ]),
      { type: "reflect", think: ["Which one habit of waste in my home will I change this week? || Uyimdagi qaysi bitta isrof odatini bu hafta o‘zgartiraman?", "Have I ever used something public as if it did not matter because it was not mine? || Biror marta jamoat narsasini o‘zimniki bo‘lmagani uchun ahamiyatsizdek ishlatganmanmi?"],
        home: ["Do a family “waste walk” through the house: count lights, taps, plugs and food in the fridge. Pick three things to fix, and check again in a month. || Oila bo‘lib uy bo‘ylab “isrof sayri” qiling: chiroqlar, jo‘mraklar, rozetkalar va muzlatgichdagi ovqatni sanang. Tuzatish uchun uchta narsani tanlang va bir oydan keyin qayta tekshiring."] },
      L("Key takeaways || Asosiy xulosalar", [
        "Saving water, gas and electricity is the duty of every member of society. || Suv, gaz va elektrni tejash jamiyatning har bir a’zosi burchi.",
        "Looking after machines is part of not wasting. Winding back a meter is theft from everyone. || Asbob-uskunani avaylash isrof qilmaslikning bir qismi. Hisoblagichni orqaga aylantirish — hammadan o‘g‘rilik.",
        "Fight isrof together, with knowledge, example and patience. || Isrofga ilm, o‘rnak va sabr bilan birgalikda qarshi turing.",
