    quiz: [
      { q: "Whose duty is it to save water and electricity, according to the book? || Kitobga ko‘ra suv va elektrni tejash kimning burchi?", options: ["Only the government’s || Faqat davlatning", "Every member of society || Jamiyatning har bir a’zosi", "Only the rich || Faqat boylar", "No one’s || Hech kimning"], answer: 1, why: "Every citizen shares in it. || Har bir fuqaro bunga sherik.", src: B("Isrof qilishdan to‘xtang!") },
      { q: "What did the car mechanic say is the biggest waste now? || Avtoulov ustasi hozir eng katta isrof nima, dedi?", options: ["Food || Taom", "Machines that are not looked after || Avaylanmaydigan texnika", "Books || Kitoblar", "Water only || Faqat suv"], answer: 1, why: "People drive but do not maintain. || Odamlar haydaydi, lekin avaylamaydi.", src: B("Turli maishiy isroflar") },
      { q: "Making a meter show less than was used is… || Hisoblagichni kamroq ko‘rsatadigan qilish…", options: ["…clever saving || …aqlli tejash", "…theft from the whole public || …butun jamiyatdan o‘g‘rilik", "…allowed if bills are high || …hisob katta bo‘lsa mayli", "…a small mistake || …kichik xato"], answer: 1, why: "It takes from orphans, pensioners and the needy too. || Bu yetimlar, nafaqaxo‘rlar va muhtojlarning ham haqqini oladi.", src: B("Turli maishiy isroflar") },
      { q: "Which verse forbids consuming others’ wealth unjustly? || Qaysi oyat birovning molini botil yo‘l bilan yeyishdan qaytaradi?", options: ["4:29 || 4:29", "1:1 || 1:1", "112:1 || 112:1", "114:1 || 114:1"], answer: 0, why: "“Do not consume one another’s wealth unjustly.” || “Mollaringizni o‘rtangizda botil yo‘l bilan yemang.”", src: "Quran 4:29" },
      { q: "What is a thrifty habit for lights? || Chiroq bo‘yicha tejamkor odat qaysi?", options: ["Leave them on for days || Kunlab yoniq qoldirish", "The last one out turns them off || Oxirgi chiqqan o‘chiradi", "Never turn them on || Hech yoqmaslik", "Use more bulbs || Ko‘proq lampochka"], answer: 1, why: "A small habit with a big effect. || Kichik odat, katta ta’sir.", src: B("Isrof qilishdan to‘xtang!") },
      { q: "According to the conclusion, how should isrof be fought? || Xotimaga ko‘ra isrofga qanday qarshi turish kerak?", options: ["Alone, in secret || Yolg‘iz, yashirincha", "Together: individuals, families and society || Birgalikda: shaxs, oila va jamiyat", "Only by the government || Faqat davlat", "It cannot be fought || Unga qarshi turib bo‘lmaydi"], answer: 1, why: "It is a shared duty. || Bu umumiy burch.", src: B("Xotima") },
      { q: "What comes first in fighting isrof? || Isrofga qarshi kurashda birinchi nima?", options: ["Punishment || Jazo", "Knowledge and teaching || Ilm va tushuntirish", "Buying new things || Yangi narsa olish", "Silence || Sukut"], answer: 1, why: "Imams, schools, media and families all teach. || Imomlar, maktablar, matbuot va oilalar o‘rgatadi.", src: B("Xotima") },
      { q: "Does the harm of isrof end in this world? || Isrofning zarari bu dunyoda tugaydimi?", options: ["Yes || Ha", "No, it reaches into the Hereafter || Yo‘q, oxiratga ham o‘tadi", "Only for the poor || Faqat kambag‘allar uchun", "Only for adults || Faqat kattalar uchun"], answer: 1, why: "The book’s conclusion. || Kitob xulosasi.", src: B("Xotima") },
      { q: "Replacing a working phone every year just to have the newest is… || Ishlab turgan telefonni faqat eng yangisi bo‘lsin deb har yili almashtirish…", options: ["…a kind of isrof || …isrofning bir turi", "…a duty || …burch", "…charity || …sadaqa", "…always needed || …doim kerak"], answer: 0, why: "Using a blessing beyond need, often to impress. || Ne’matni ehtiyojdan ortiq, ko‘pincha ko‘z-ko‘z uchun ishlatish.", src: B("Turli maishiy isroflar") },
      { q: "When does thrift become a good deed? || Tejamkorlik qachon solih amalga aylanadi?", options: ["Never || Hech qachon", "When done to obey Allah and benefit family and society || Allohga itoat va oila hamda jamiyatga foyda uchun qilinganda", "Only if others see it || Faqat boshqalar ko‘rsa", "Only in Ramadan || Faqat Ramazonda"], answer: 1, why: "Then it earns reward. || Shunda savob keltiradi.", src: B("Isrof qilishdan to‘xtang!") },
